--- Intermediate finding recorded for honesty ---
First fix attempt flocked the store file itself; on macOS that collides with
SQLite's own POSIX locks and all 5 store tests failed with DatabaseBusy
("database is locked"). Final fix moves the advisory open lock to a 0600
sidecar file (<store>.lock) held for the whole open sequence:
